meta {
  name: Get All User
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/user
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All User

  This request is used to get all user. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes (Admin only), and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — User fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "user fetched",
    "data": {
      "current_page": 1,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "17963858-9771-11ee-8f4a-3216422910r4",
          "username": "flazefy",
          "email": "flazen.edu@gmail.com",
          "telegram_user_id": "1317625970",
          "telegram_is_valid": 1,
          "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47",
          "updated_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
        }
      ],
      "last_page": 1,
      "per_page": 14,
      "total": 1
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login | permission denied. only admin can use this request"
  }
```

  **404 — user failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "user not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}